{"page":231,"verses":[{"verse_key":"11:82","surah":11,"ayah":82,"ar_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا جَآءَ أَمْرُنَا جَعَلْنَا عَـٰلِيَهَا سَافِلَهَا وَأَمْطَرْنَا عَلَيْهَا حِجَارَةً مِّن سِجِّيلٍ مَّنضُودٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"And so when what We had ordained came about, We turned their town upside down and rained down stones of baked clay on it, layer upon layer,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَلَمَّا","en_gloss":"So when","transliteration":"falammā","verse_key":"11:82"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَآءَ","en_gloss":"came","transliteration":"jāa","verse_key":"11:82"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَمْرُنَا","en_gloss":"Our Command","transliteration":"amrunā","verse_key":"11:82"},{"pos":4,"ar":"جَعَلْنَا","en_gloss":"We made","transliteration":"jaʿalnā","verse_key":"11:82"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَـٰلِيَهَا","en_gloss":"its upside","transliteration":"ʿāliyahā","verse_key":"11:82"},{"pos":6,"ar":"سَافِلَهَا","en_gloss":"its downside","transliteration":"sāfilahā","verse_key":"11:82"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَأَمْطَرْنَا","en_gloss":"and We rained","transliteration":"wa-amṭarnā","verse_key":"11:82"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَلَيْهَا","en_gloss":"upon them","transliteration":"ʿalayhā","verse_key":"11:82"},{"pos":9,"ar":"حِجَارَةًۭ","en_gloss":"stones","transliteration":"ḥijāratan","verse_key":"11:82"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"11:82"},{"pos":11,"ar":"سِجِّيلٍۢ","en_gloss":"baked clay","transliteration":"sijjīlin","verse_key":"11:82"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَّنضُودٍۢ","en_gloss":"(in) layers","transliteration":"manḍūdin","verse_key":"11:82"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٨٢","en_gloss":"(82)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"11:82"}]},{"verse_key":"11:83","surah":11,"ayah":83,"ar_uthmani":"مُّسَوَّمَةً عِندَ رَبِّكَ ۖ وَمَا هِىَ مِنَ ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ بِبَعِيدٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"marked from your Lord. It is not far from the evildoers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"مُّسَوَّمَةً","en_gloss":"Marked","transliteration":"musawwamatan","verse_key":"11:83"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عِندَ","en_gloss":"from","tra